      "body": "(cherry picked from commit 7f009e70a62a09b8b9990a2258b2a2d2c8a8556a)\n\nThis feature requests SYS_ADMIN for nsys profiling on NVCRE. Where the driver sets RmProfilingAdminOnly=1, nsys records no GPU kernels without CAP_SYS_ADMIN. NsysPlugin now adds it to NvcreExecutor.capabilities and reports Error if the installed nemo_run cannot request capabilities.\n",
